      "summary": "将 Gateway 返回的原始 agent 行数据转换为前端 AgentInfo 结构，补齐 metadata 兼容字段及 isLoaded/hasError/status 等状态标记。",
      "tags": ["utility", "data-mapping", "serialization"],
      "complexity": "simple"
