      "summary": "Gateway 钱包认证 hook，实现 EIP-191 challenge→签名→JWT 的完整流程：自动请求 challenge、用 wagmi walletClient 签名、换取 access token，并拉取租户/套餐/自有 key 上下文信息，附带自动续期逻辑。",
      "tags": ["hook", "authentication", "wallet", "eip-191", "jwt"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "认证基于 EIP-191 个人消息签名（challenge 携带时间戳与过期校验），token 通过内存 ref 缓存并结合环境变量网关地址使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:frontend/hooks/useGatewayAuth.ts:useGatewayAuth",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "useGatewayAuth",
